How to profile your app:
1. Install React DevTools browser extension
2. Open DevTools → Profiler tab
3. Click Record (●)
4. Interact with your app (type, click, scroll)
5. Click Stop
6. See which components rendered, how often, and how long they took

Look for:
- Gray bars  → Component rendered but was skipped by memo (good)
- Colored bars → Component actually re-rendered (investigate why)
- Tall bars  → Slow renders that need optimization
```

