## Key Optimization Decisions

```text
Symptom                           →  Solution
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Expensive computation runs        →  useMemo
  on every render

Function recreated on             →  useCallback
  every render

Child re-renders when             →  React.memo
  props haven't changed           →  (+ useCallback/useMemo for objects/functions)

Slow initial load (large          →  lazy() + Suspense
  bundle size)

Slow scrolling with               →  Virtualization (react-window)
  large lists
```

---

## Chapter Summary

- Use **React DevTools Profiler** to measure before you optimize
- **React.memo** skips child re-renders when props are unchanged
- **useCallback** stabilizes function references passed as props
- **useMemo** caches expensive calculations between renders
- **Lazy loading** splits your bundle — components only download when navigated to
- **Virtualization** renders only visible list items from very large lists

