## Query Priority (How to Find Elements)

```text
Priority  Query                     When to Use
────────────────────────────────────────────────
1st       getByRole                 Buttons, inputs, headings, links
2nd       getByLabelText            Form inputs with associated labels
3rd       getByPlaceholderText      Inputs with placeholder text
4th       getByText                 Any element by visible text
5th       getByDisplayValue        Select/input with current value
6th       getByAltText             Images
7th       getByTestId              Last resort — add data-testid attribute
```

