## File-Based Routing (App Router)

In Next.js, the folder structure IS your routes:

```text
app/
├── page.jsx              → /
├── about/
│   └── page.jsx          → /about
├── blog/
│   ├── page.jsx          → /blog
│   └── [slug]/
│       └── page.jsx      → /blog/:slug  (dynamic route)
├── layout.jsx            → Shared layout for all routes
└── not-found.jsx         → 404 page
```

